  "readmeExcerpt": "# @open-mercato/scheduler ⏰\n\nDatabase-backed scheduling for recurring and delayed jobs in Open Mercato.\n\n`@open-mercato/scheduler` manages scheduled tasks with robust runtime control, queue integration, and visibility for ops teams.\n\n## Why this package ✨\n\n- 📅 Cron and delayed job orchestration\n- 🧩 Native integration with Open Mercato queue/events\n- 🔎 Operational visibility and safer automation flows\n- ⚡ Reliable scheduling for business-critical tasks\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nyarn add @open-mercato/scheduler\n```\n\n## Learn more\n\n- GitHub (package): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato/tree/main/packages/scheduler\n- GitHub (project): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato\n- Docs: https://docs.openmercato.com\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
